<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- BAGALATIYA- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">BaGalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo LwaPawulu KuBaGalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaGalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo LwaPawulu Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAGALATIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibbuku lyaBaGalatiya lyakalembwa amutumwa Pawulu (BaGalatiya 1: 1). Lwakali lugwalo Pawulu ndwaakalembela mbungano zyaku Galatiya akati kachiindi chilimbuli minyaka ilimakumi aane aminyaka ilimusanu ayitatu kuyoosika kuminyaka ilimakumi alimusanu aminyaka ilimusanu ayibili kaali Jesu wazyalwa. BaGalatiya kuyeeyelwa kuti bakali bantu bakali kukkala muGalatiya muchilikiti chaRoma. Basikufunkununa tabakwe kasimpe loko pe kuti Pawulu wakali kuli naakalemba lugwalo oolu, pesi chisi chaEfeso aKkorinte ngiimasena akonzya kuba ngawo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu wakalembela banaKkirisitu, baJuda abateesi baJuda pe, mumbungano zili muGalatiya. Wakalemba kalangene kapati kuti akazyaniye anjiisyo yakubeja eeyo yamba kuti banaKkirisitu beelede kutobela milawu yamaJuda ili muChizuminano Chakale, kapati kupalulwa. Kwakali nkamu yabantu akati kabanaKkirisitu itegwa mbaJuda bakalikuyanda banaKkirisitu batali baJuda kuti bapalulwe. Alubo bakabuzisisya atala anguzu zyabutumwa bwaPawulu. Pawulu wakakwabilila butumwa bwakwe akubaambila lumwi lwalwano lwakwe (BaGalatiya 1:11—2:14) alimwi wakalwanina makani mabotu, akupandulula kuti lufutuko lujanwa luzutu mukwiinda mulusyomo muli Jesu Kkirisitu (BaGalatiya 2:16). Niimpindu yabuuya bwaLeza mbwatondeezya, peepe bantu nzibachita.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu utalika lugwalo lwakwe akujuzya imbungano zilimuGalatiya (BaGalatiya 1:1-5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo Pawulu upandulula atala abuumi bwakwe mbwakapona kuti akwabilile cheelelo chakwe chakuyiisya akutondeezya kuti wakeezya kuponena mumulawu pesi teezyakabeleka pe (BaGalatiya 1:6—2:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela upandulula lubo atala amulimu wamulawu aluzyalo mulufutuko (BaGalatiya 3:1—4:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo upa aamwi malayilile akupona bunaKkirisitu bululeme (BaGalatiya 5:1—6:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu ujinsya lugwalo lwakwe akujuzya akubakombelezya kuti kuchitululwa kuba muntu mupya aLeza zilikabotu kapati kwiinda milawu yaanze, ilimbuli kupalulwa (BaGalatiya 6:11-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Pawulu mutumwa, peepe uzwa kubantu nikuba mukwiinda kumuntu, pesi mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu aLeza Taata, wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />aboonse bakwesu mbindilaabo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">kumbungano zyaku Galatiya:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Luzyalo kulindinywe aluumuno luzwa kuli Leza Taata aMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />ooyo wakalyaaba nkaambo kazibi zyesu kuti atuvune kuzwa kububi bwachiindi eechino, mukwiinda kuluyando lwaLeza wesu aTaata; <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />kuli Leza kukabe bulemu kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleya Kuzwa Kumakani Mabotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ndagamba loko kuti mwafwambana kumuchija ooyo wakamwiita muluzyalo lwaKkirisitu mpawo mwatobela makani aambi. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Peepe kuti kuli aambi makani, pesi kuli bamwi bamupenzya alimwi bayanda kuleeyesya makani mabotu aKkirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Pesi nikuba ndiswe, naba mungelo uzwa kujulu, taakwe weelede kumukambawukila makani asiyene ayaayo ngitwakamukambawukila, ngatukwe. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Mbuli mbutwakaamba kale, aboobo lino ndaamba lubo, kuti umwi kamukambawukila makani asiyene kuli aayo ngimwakatambula kale, ngatukwe.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Lino ndiyanduula kulumbilizigwa abantu na, nikuba kwaLeza? Nikuba kuti ndeezya kubotezya bantu? Kuti ndachili kubotezya bantu, tandeelede kuba mulanda waKkirisitu pe.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulu Mbwakaba Mutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Nkaambo bakwesu, ndiyanda kuti muzibe, kuti makani mabotu akakambawukwa andime teemakani azwa kumuntu pe. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Nkaambo teendakaatambula kuzwa kumuntu pe, nikuba kuyiisigwa amuntu, pesi akaza mukwiinda muchiyubunuzyo chaJesu Kkirisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nkaambo mwakamvwa buumi bwangu bwachiindi mbundakali kupona muchiJuda, mbundakapenzya imbungano yaLeza chabukali alimwi ndakeezya kwiinyonyoona. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Alimwi ndakayendelela anembo muchiJuda kandili kunembo abayingi basaama akati kabantu bakulindiswe, aboobo ndakali musungu kapati nkaambo kaziyanza zyabamataata.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Pesi Leza ooyo wakandisala kanditana ndazyalwa, alimwi wakandiita mukwiinda muluzyalo lwakwe, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />wakabotelwa kuyubununa Mwana wakwe kulindime, kuchitila kuti ndikonzye kumukambawuka akati kabantu batali baJuda, teendakayiisigwa amuntu kufumbwa pe, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />nikuba kwiinka kuJerusalemu kuli baabo bakali batumwa kunembo lyangu, pesi ndakayinka kuArabbiya; alimwi lubo ndakabweeda kuDamasikkasi. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Eelyo nikwakayinda minyaka iitatu ndakayinka kuJerusalemu kuyooswaya Sifasi, mpawo ndakaakukkala anguwe kwamazuba alikkumi amusanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Pesi taakwe bambi batumwa mbindakabona kunze kwaJakkobbu mwanike waMwami Jesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Muli nzindilii kumulembela, kunembo lyaLeza, tandibeji pe!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Eelyo ndakayinka muzilikiti zyaSiriya aSilisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Alimwi teebakalina ndibona pe kumbungano zyaKkirisitu muJudiya, <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />bakamvwa biyo kakwaambwa kuti, “Ooyo wakali kutupenzya lino uliikukambawuka atala alusyomo ndwakeezya kunyonyoona.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Alimwi bakalumbayizya Leza ankaambo kandime.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pawulu Abamwi Batumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Eelyo nikwakayinda minyaka ilikkumi ayine ndakayinka lubo kuJerusalemu aBbanabbasi, alimwi ndakayinka aTayitasi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ndakeenda nkaambo Leza wakandiyubunwida, alimwi ndakapandulula mukavwindi kunembo lyabaabo bakali achiwa mbundakakambawuka kunembo lyabatali baJuda, ambweni muliimwi inzila ndinochijaana nikuba mbundakali kuchijaana kube kwabuyo. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Pesi nikuba Tayitasi, wakali andime, teebakamwaangila pe kuti apalulwe, nikuba kuti wakali muGirikki. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Aaka kaambo kabupalule kakabuka ankaambo kabakwesu babeji bakeetwa mukavwindi, bakalisyanikizya mukati kuti batweele lwangunuko lwesu ndutuli aalo muli Kkirisitu Jesu, kuti bakatunjizye mubuzike, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />kuli mbabo teetwakazumina kuti tulifwinsye nikuba kayindi kaniini, kuti kasimpe kamakani mabotu kakakwabililwe nkaambo kandinywe.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Alimwi kuzwa kuli baabo bakali kulemekwa kuba chimwi kufumbwa mbubakalibede taakwe musiyano pe kulindime, Leza tasaluli pe, aabo, ndaamba kuti, bakali kulemekwa taakwe nchibakayungizya pe. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Pesi muli iimwi nzila, nibakabona kuti ndakasyomegwa amakani mabotu kuli batali baJuda, mbuli Pita mbwakapegwa makani mabotu kubaJuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Nkaambo woonse wakabeleka mukwiinda mumutumwa Pita kumulimu kubaJuda wakabeleka mukwiinda mulindime alubo kuli batali baJuda, <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />alimwi Jakkobbu aSifasi aJoni aabo bakali kulemekwa mbuli misemo mumbungano nibakabona luzyalo oolo ndundakapegwa, bakapa ndime aBbanabbasi cheelelo chabulidilano, kuti tweelede kwiinka kuli batali baJuda akubaJuda, <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />bakayanda luzutu kuti tuyeeye bachete, nchicho loko nchindakali kuyandisya kuchita.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulu Unyemena Sifasi kuAntiyokki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Pesi Sifasi naakasika kuAntiyokki ndakamukalalila antanganana, nkaambo wakali amulandu. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Nkaambo kakutanasika bamwi bantu bakazwa kuli Jakkobbu, wakalya abatali baJuda; pesi nibakasika wakasosoloka mpawo walipambula, kayoowa nkamu yabaJuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Alimwi anguwe abamwi baJuda boonse bakatalika kuchita mbuli nguwe kuupawupa, mane nikuba Bbanabbasi alakwe wakanjila mukuwupawupa kwabo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Pesi nindakabona kuti tabaluleme mbuli mukasimpe kali mumakani mabotu, ndakaambila Sifasi kunembo lyabo boonse kuti, “Kuti iwe, nikuba muJuda, wapona mbuli utali muJuda alimwi peepe mbuli muJuda, nga ulaangila biyeni batali baJuda kuti bapone mbuli baJuda?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">BaJuda Abatali baJuda Balafutulwa Alusyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Iswe lwesu, nituli baJuda akuzyalwa alimwi peepe batali baJuda basizibi, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />anukuti tulizi kuti muntu talulamikwi amilimu yamulawu pe pesi mukwiinda mulusyomo muli Jesu Kkirisitu, nikuba iswe alesu twakasyoma muli Kkirisitu Jesu, kuti tukalulamikwe alusyomo muliKkirisitu, alimwi peepe amilimu yamulawu, nkaambo amilimu yamulawu taakwe naba uumwi uyoolulamikwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Pesi kuti, mukweezya kwesu kuti tululamikwe muli Kkirisitu, iswe lwesu twakajanika katuli basizibi, Kkirisitu eelyo waba mulanda wachibi na? Peepe teembubo pe! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Pesi kuti ndayakulula lubo zintu nzindakamweya, eelyo ndalitondeezya sikutyola mulawu. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Nkaambo mukwiinda mumulawu ndakafwa kumulawu, kuti ndikaponene muliLeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ndakagankaminwa antoomwe aKkirisitu, tandichili ndime pe nindipona, pesi Kkirisitu nguupona mulindime, alimwi buumi mbundipona lino mumubili ndibupona alusyomo muMwana waLeza, ooyo wakandiyanda akulyaaba nkaambo kangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Tandikonzyi kukaka luzyalo lwaLeza pe, nkaambo naa kululamikwa nkwamukwiinda amulawu, chaamba kuti Kkirisitu wakafwida chabiyo.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulawu Nikuba Lusyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Inywe nibaGalatiya bafubafuba! Ngwani wakamulowa, kunembo lyameso aani Jesu Kkirisitu mpaakapanduluulwa antanganana mbuli ugankamidwe? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Amundizumizye ndimubuzye eechi luzutu, mwakatambula Muuya ankaambo kamilimu yamulawu na, nikuba kuti akumvwa alusyomo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Muli bafubafuba loko na? Kamuli mwakatanguna aMuuya, lino muliikujinsya amubili na? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Saa mwakapenzegwa zintu zyiingi chabiyo na? Kuti chachoonzyo zyakali zyabiyo. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ooyo waabila Muuya kulindinywe alimwi kabeleka zigambyo akati kanu uchita oobo amilimu yamulawu na, nikuba akumvwa alusyomo?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Amuyeeye Abburahamu “wakasyoma Leza, alimwi wakaambwa mbuli musalali.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Aboobo mwazibona kuti mbantu balusyomo aabo bategwa mbana baAbburahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Alimwi malembe, akaamba kale kuti Leza uyoolulamika batali baJuda alusyomo, akakambawukwa kale makani mabotu kuli Abburahamu, kuti, “Muli nduwe manyika woonse ayoolongezegwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Eelyo aboobo, aabo bantu balusyomo balalongezegwa aamwi aAbburahamu wakali alusyomo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Nkaambo boonse babikkide moyo kumilimu yamulawu balikunsi alutuko; nkaambo kulilembedwe kuti, “Ngatukwe woonse utakkalilili muzintu zyoonse zilembedwe mubbuku lyamulawu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Lino kuli antanganana kuti taakwe muntu ululamikwa kunembo lyaLeza kwiinda amulawu; nkaambo “Kufumbwa ululeme uyoopona mukwiinda mulusyomo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Pesi mulawu tuukkali alusyomo pe, nkaambo “Kufumbwa uzichita eezi uyoopona anzizyo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kkirisitu wakatinununa kuzwa kulutuko lwamulawu, nguwe wakaba lutuko nkaambo kesu, nkaambo kulilembedwe kuti, “Ngatukwe woonse ulyaangilila amusamu” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />kuchitila kuti muli Kkirisitu Jesu chilongezyo chaAbburahamu chikaakusike kuli batali baJuda, kuti tukatambule chisyomezyo chaMuuya mukwiinda mulusyomo.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawu Achisyomezyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Kupa chitondeezyo chabuntu, nibakwesu: taakwe umwi ukonzya kumweya kuyanda kwamuntu pe, nikuba kuyungizya kuli nkuko, kuti chazuminanwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Lino zisyomezyo zyakachitwa kuli Abburahamu akulunyungu lwakwe. Tachaambi kuti, “Alimwi kulunyungu,” kachitondeka kubayingi; pesi, kachitondeka kuli uumwi, “Alimwi kulunyungu lwanu,” chaamba kuti Kkirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Eechi nchindaamba: mulawu, ooyo wakasika nikwakayinda minyaka ili myaanda iine amakumi aatatu, tuukonzyi kulobya chizuminano chakale chakazumininwa aLeza, aboobo mbuli kuchita chisyomezyo chabiyo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Nkaambo kuti lukono kaluli lwamulawu, nkukwaamba kuti taluchili lwachisyomezyo pe; pesi Leza wakalupa Abburahamu achisyomezyo.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Eelyo nkaamboonzi nikuli mulawu? Wakayungizigwa ankaambo kakubisya kwesu, mane lunyungu lukaze kuli yooyo wakachitwa chisyomezyo; alimwi chakananikwa abaangelo mukwiinda muli simwiimaakati. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Lino sikwiimaakati uyiimikilila uyinda uumwi pesi Leza ngumwi.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulimu Wamulawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Eelyo mulawu ulwanisya zisyomezyo zyaLeza na? Peepe; nkaambo kuti mulawu wakapegwa kuti upe kupona, eelyo bululami nichoonzyo bwakali kunooba bwamulawu. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Pesi malembe akabikka zintu zyoonse kuchibi, kuchitila kuti eecho chakasyomezegwa kulusyomo muli Jesu Kkirisitu chikapegwe kuli baabo basyoma.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Lino lusyomo kalutanasika, twakali kupona kunsi amulawu, katubikkidwe aansi katudyaamizidwe mane lusyomo lukayubununwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Kuchitila kuti mulawu wakali sikutweendelezya mane kuza kwaKkirisitu, kuti tukalulamikwe alusyomo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Pesi lino ankaambo kakuti lusyomo lwasika, tatuchili aansi asikutweendelezya pe.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Nkaambo muli Kkirisitu Jesu muli bana baLeza moonse, mukwiinda mulusyomo, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />nkaambo mbuli bayiingi banu mbubakabbapatizigwa muli Kkirisitu bakasama Kkirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Taakwe nikuba muJuda nikuba mu Girikki, taakwe muzike nikuba waangunidwe, taakwe mwaalumi nikuba mwanakazi; nkaambo moonse muli bamwi muli Kkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Alimwi kuti kamuli baKkirisitu, eelyo muli lunyungu lwaAbburahamu, muli basikukona bakwe mbuli chisyomezyo.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Kusyoma Kkirisitu Nkuutupa Kuba Bana BaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ndaamba kuti sikukona, kuti kali mwana, tali mbubo kwiinda muzike, nikuba kuti nguumuna wabuvubi boonse; <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />pesi uli aansi abaleli abamweendelezya mane kubuzuba bwakabikkwa awisi. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Mbumbubo andiswe; nitwakali bana, twakali bazike kutunsiyansiya twamyuuya yamumulengalenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Pesi chiindi nichakazulila, Leza wakatuma Mwana wakwe, wakazyalwa kumwanakazi, wakazyalwa kunsi amulawu, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />kuti anunune aabo bakali aansi amulawu, kuchitila kuti tukatangilwe mbuli bana baLeza.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Alimwi nkaambo muli bana, Leza wakatuma Muuya waMwana wakwe mumyoyo yesu, woompolola kuti, “Abba! Taata!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Aboobo mukwiinda muli Leza tuchili muzike pe pesi mwana, alimwi kuti kuli mwana eelyo uli sikukona.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulu Mbwalipenzya Atala Ambungano yaBaGalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kuchiindi chakayinda, kamutana ziba Leza, mwakali mubuzike kuzintu eezyo abulenge ziteensi baleza; <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />pesi lino mbuli mbumwakaziba Leza, nikuba kuti mulizibikene aLeza, ngamulabweeda biyeni lubo kubukompami abatakwe mulimu, muchiyanda kuba bazike bali biyeni lubo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mubamba mazuba amyeezi azyiindi aminyaka! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ndayoowa kuti ndakabelekela chabiyo alindinywe.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Nibakwesu, ndamukumbila, mube mbuli mbundibede, nkaambo andime ndakali mbuli mbumubede. Taakwe chibi nchimwakachita pe kulindime; <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />mulizi kuti zyakali ankaambo kamachise amubili kuti ndikambawuke makani mabotu kulindinywe lutaanzi; <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />alimwi nikuba chiimo changu chakali chakusunkwa kuli ndinywe, taakwe nimwakandiwela pe nikuba kundilangila aansi, pesi mwakanditambula mbuli mungelo waLeza, mbuli Kkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Niinzi nchimwakamvwa chakapa kuti mukkutikane? Nkaambo ndimujisidili bukamboni bwakuti, koonzyo zyalikukonzeka, mwali kunoononkola meso aanu mpawo kamundipa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Eelyo ndaba sinkondonyokwe na akumwaambila kasimpe?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Bachita zyiingi atala andinywe, pesi kakutakwe chibotu pe; bayanda kumujalila aanze, kuti mubachitile zyiingi. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Nkaambo kakuchita bubotu nchibotu kuti kuchitwe oobo lyoonse, alimwi peepe luzutu nindili andinywe. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Nibana bangu, aabo mbindili mukumyongwa lubo mane Kkirisitu abumbwe mulindinywe! <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ndilombozya kuba andinywe lino akusandula maambwiido aangu, nkaambo ndapengaana atala andinywe.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano waHaga aSara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Mundaambile, inywe nimuyandisya kuba aansi amulawu, tamuumvwina mulawu? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nkaambo kulilembedwe kuti Abburahamu wakali abana babili, umwi wakazyalwa kumuzike alimwi umwi kumwanakazi walwaangunuko. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Pesi mwana wamuzike wakazyalwa mukwiinda kumubili, mwana wamwanakazi walwaangunuko wakazyalwa mukwiinda kuchisyomezyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Lino ooyu mukozyanisyo biyo: banakazi aaba nzizuminano zibili. Uumwi uzwa kuchilundu chaSinayi, uzyala bana babuzike; nguHaga. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Lino Haga nchiichilundu chaSinayi muArabbiya; wiimikilila Jerusalemu ilisunu, nkaambo ulimubuzike abana bakwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Pesi Jerusalemu ulikujulu ulaangunukide, alimwi mbiibaama besu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Nkaambo kulilembedwe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Sekelela, iwe nungomwa, eeyo itazyali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">pasuka mpawo woompolole, iwe nuutamyongwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Nkaambo bana bawulekedwe mbayingi loko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kwiinda bana bayooyo ukwetwe.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Lino inywe, bakwesu, mbuli Ayizekki, muli bana bachisyomezyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Pesi mbuli kuchiindi eechiya ooyo wakali wazyalwa kumubili wakapenzya ooyo wakazyalwa mbuli kuMuuya, aboobo mbukubede lino. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Pesi malembe atyeni? “Tanda muzike amwana wakwe mulombe; nkaambo mwana mulombe wamuzike takonzyi kujana lukono amwana mulombe wamwanakazi walwaangunuko.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Aboobo, bakwesu, tatuli bana bamuzike pe pesi bamwanakazi walwaangunuko.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Bupalule Tabukwe Milimu Muli Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Nkaambo kalwaangunuko Kkirisitu wakatwaangununa, nkikaako ngamwiimikile nji, alimwi mutalituuli lubo kujokwe lyabuzike.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Lino ime, Pawulu, ndaamba kuti kulindinywe kuti mwatambula bupalule, Kkirisitu unooli katachikwe mulimu pe kuli ndinywe. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Ndasinizya lubo kuli woonse utambula bupalule kuti ulaangidwe kubamba mulawu woonse. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Mwalipambula kuzwa kuli Kkirisitu, inywe nimuchiyanda kululamikwa amulawu; mwazwa kuzwa kuluzyalo. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Nkaambo mukwiinda muMuuya, alusyomo, tulindila bulangilizi bwabululami. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Nkaambo muli Kkirisitu Jesu bupalule nikuba kutapalulwa tazikwe mulimu pe, pesi cheelede ndusyomo lubeleka mukwiinda muluyando.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mwakalikuchijaana kabotu loko; ngwani wakamukasya kuzwa kukuswiilila kasimpe? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kumukombelezya takuzwi kuli Leza pe ooyo wakamwiita. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Busweezyo buche bulabizya mulwi woonse. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ndili abusichaamba muMwami kuti tamukwe kuyoobweza muzeezo umbi pe kwiinda wangu; alimwi ooyo umupenzya uyoobetekwa, kufumbwa ngwani.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Bakwesu, pesi kuti mebo, kandichikambawuka bupalule, nkaamboonzi nindichipenzegwa? Aboobo chilebyo chachiingano chagwisigwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ndilombozya aabo bamunyonganya kuti balizibe!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Bakwesu, nkaambo inywe mwakayitwa kulwaangunuko, mutabelesyi lwaangunuko lwanu mbuli mweenya wakubotezya mibili luzutu, pesi mukwiinda muluyando amube balanda bawumwi awumwi. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Nkaambo mulawu woonse ulazuzukizigwa mumulawu uumwi waamba kuti, “Yanda nguyakilene aawe mbuli mbuliyanda.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Pesi kuti mwalumana akulyana ngamuchenjele kuti mutamanani.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milimu Yamubili Amichelo YaMuuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Pesi ndaamba kuti, mweende chaMuuya, ankaambo kacheechi tamukwe kuzuzukizya ziyandisyo zyamubili. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Nkaambo ziyandisyo zyamubili zilalwana aMuuya, alimwi ziyandisyo zyaMuuya zilalwana amubili; nkaambo eezi zilakazyana, kuti zikukasye kukuchita eecho nchuyanda. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Pesi kuti kamuzulidwa aMuuya tamuli aansi amulawu pe.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Lino milimu yamubili ili antanganana: bwaamu, busofwazi, zisusi zibi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kukomba mizimu, bulozi, nkondo, bulwani, ibbivwe, lunyemo, kutangala, inkondo, mipampumipampu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />munyono, kukolwa, misalo yamunyika, azimwi zili boobo. Ndamuchenjezya, mbuli mbundakamuchenjezya kale, kuti aabo bachita zintu ziliboobo tabakwe kuyookona bwami bwaLeza pe.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Pesi michelo yaMuuya nduyando, lukondo, luumuno, moyomulamfu, buuya, bubotu, kusyomeka, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />kulibombya, kulibatamika; atala azeezi taakwe mulawu pe. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Alimwi aabo balikuli Kkirisitu Jesu bakagankamina mibili yabo azisusi zyayo aziyandisyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Kuti twapona achaMuuya, alubo ngatweendelezegwe achaMuuya. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Tatweelede kulisumpula pe, peepe kudyokolana, peepe bbivwe kuli uumwi awumwi.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Kunyampuzyana Mikuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Bakwesu, naa muntu wazundwa muchibi, inywe nimupona chamuuya mweelede kumuboozya amoyo mubombe. Amuchenjele, ambweeni inywe alanu mulasunkwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ngamunyampuzyane mikuli, alimwi mukuchita oobu mulazuzikizya mulawu waKkirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Nkaambo naa umwi wayeeya kuti nchimwi chintu, anukuti peepe, ooyo ulalyeena lwakwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Pesi uumwi awumwi ngasunke mulimu wakwe, alimwi eelyo kulikankayizya kwakwe kulaba kwakwe aliikke peepe kuli ngwayakilenaawe. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Nkaambo muntu woonse weelede kunyampula mukuli wakwe.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Muleke ooyo uyiisigwa ijwi lyaLeza aabane zyoonse zintu zibotu ayooyo uyiisya.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mutayenwi; Leza taniyakwi, nkaambo kufumbwa muntu nchaabyala, nchiinchicho nchayotebula lubo. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Nkaambo ooyo ubyala bukompami kumubili wakwe uyootebula bukompami kuzwa kumubili; pesi ooyo ubyala kumuuya uyootebula buumi butamani kuzwa kuMuuya. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Alimwi tutakatali mukuchita bubotu, nkaambo muchiindi cheelede tuyootebula, kuti teetwabola moyo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Eelyo aboobo, mbuli mbutujisi mweeenya, ngatuchite chibotu kubantu boonse, alimwi kapati kuli aabo bakuŋanda yalusyomo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulu Ulemba Majwi Akumamanino Ajaanza Lyakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ngamulange mabala mapati ngindimulembela aluboko lwangu ndimwini. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Chili kuli baabo bayanda kulitondeezya kabotu mumibili kuti bamupenzye kuti mupalulwe, alimwi kuchitila kuti batapenzegwi luzutu nkaambo kachiingano chaKkirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Nkaambo nikuba aabo bapalulwa, tababambi mulawu pe, pesi bayanda kuti inywe mupalulwe kuti babe abulemu mumibili yanu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Pesi tandikwe kulikankayizya pe kunze kwakulikankayizya atala achiingano chaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, mukwiinda anchicho nyika nchiyakagankaminwa kuli ndime, andime kunyika. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Nkaambo nikuba bupalule tabwaambi chintu pe, nikuba kutapalulwa, pesi cheelede mbulenge bupya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Luumuno aluse lube kuli boonse beenda alulayo oolu, atala aIzirayeli waLeza.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Mpawo lino kutabi muntu undipenzya; nkaambo ndijisi impa zyaJesu amubili wangu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Bakwesu, luzyalo lwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu ngalube amuuya wanu. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>